   "widgets_values": [
    "# SELECT YOUR SDXL / ILLUSTRIOUS MODEL HERE\n# THEN CLICK GENERATE\n\nPick a checkpoint in both loaders once (MODEL_1 = main model, MODEL_2 = refiner; the same model in both works). Random seed every run."
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": 2,
   "type": "MarkdownNote",
   "pos": [
    560,
    -260
   ],
   "size": [
    900,
    200
   ],
   "flags": {},
   "order": 1,
   "mode": 0,
   "inputs": [],
   "outputs": [],
   "properties": {
    "Node name for S&R": "MarkdownNote"
   },
   "widgets_values": [
    "**MAIN** = the world (scene, background, colours).  **P1** / **P2** = the two characters.\n\nSaya keeps MAIN native in cross-attention and adds each character inside its mask as a *locked delta*; the PERSON gain (0.78) lives in the patched core, not in this graph.\n\nNeeds: the Saya core patch (`./saya install`), custom nodes **Saya_Couple**, **MultiMaskCouple**, **RES4LYF**. No model is included: choose any SDXL / Illustrious checkpoint in the two loaders."
   ]
  },
